# Electron-impact ionization cross-section ratios sigma_ei(A)/sigma_ei(H),
# averaged over 0.1-1 keV electron energies (fits of Lennon et al. 1988),
# as compiled in Meijerink & Spaans 2005 (A&A 436, 397, eq. D.13).
# Used to scale the secondary-ionization rate of metal species from the
# per-H-atom rate, following Quadri et al. 2025 (arXiv:2505.05556, App. B,
# eq. B.14). The preprocessor reads this table for
# --secondary-ionization targets that are not fit species (H, H2, He);
# an explicit X=ratio in the option overrides the table.
C   3.92
N   3.22
O   2.97
Si  6.67
S   6.11
Cl  6.51
Fe  4.18
C+  1.06
N+  1.24
O+  1.32
S+  1.97
Fe+ 2.38
